                                   Table "public.events"
     Column     |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |        Default         
----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+------------------------
 id             | uuid                     |           | not null | gen_random_uuid()
 timestamp      | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | 
 ingested_at    | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()
 event_type     | event_type               |           | not null | 
 severity       | event_severity           |           | not null | 'info'::event_severity
 service        | text                     |           |          | 
 actor          | text                     |           |          | 
 source_system  | text                     |           | not null | 
 source_id      | text                     |           | not null | 
 title          | text                     |           | not null | 
 payload        | jsonb                    |           | not null | '{}'::jsonb
 correlation_id | uuid                     |           |          | 
 embedding      | vector(384)              |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "events_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree ("timestamp", id)
    "events_source_system_source_id_timestamp_key" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (source_system, source_id, "timestamp")
    "events_timestamp_idx" btree ("timestamp" DESC)
    "idx_events_correlation" btree (correlation_id) WHERE correlation_id IS NOT NULL
    "idx_events_embedding" hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops) WITH (m='16', ef_construction='64')
    "idx_events_payload" gin (payload)
    "idx_events_service_time" btree (service, "timestamp" DESC) WHERE service IS NOT NULL
    "idx_events_type_time" btree (event_type, "timestamp" DESC)

